    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Night, silence, mid-2000s, a movie paused. Your friend is gone, and you're alone with yourself. What will you do?</h2><br>The Waiting Game \u2014 a &quot;meditative&quot; story about how to pass the time alone when your friend suddenly leaves for the store in the middle of the night, leaving you by yourself.<br><br>The entire gameplay revolves around - waiting, so if you're impatient, it's best to skip this game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163460/extras/f862940c33410a3b2cb979c6f2a05a12.poster.avif?t=1731078642\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163460/extras/f862940c33410a3b2cb979c6f2a05a12.webm?t=1731078642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Meet the Jerry, the dog on top.",
